    },

    "detection_weight": 0.82,
    "_weight_rationale": "|avg| of concept_map: 10G 1D. (10−1)/11 = 9/11 ≈ 0.82. self_access denied (free functions have no self/receiver).",

    // ===================================================================
    // CLOSING BLOCK [CLOSING]
    // ===================================================================

    "_X5_note": "Free functions are the module's servants — available to anyone, attached to nothing, carrying no agenda. They are the most composable unit of code because they depend only on their arguments. Every free function is a promise: give me these inputs, I will give you this output, and I will touch nothing else.",
    "_X5_scripture": "Galatians 5:13 — For, brethren, ye have been called unto liberty; only use not liberty for an occasion to the flesh, but by love serve one another."
}
